  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_4606.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La noche de este jueves se ha iniciado en el Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de Onda un nuevo ciclo de cine y cena, dedicado en esta ocasi&oacute;n a las actrices Meryl Streep y Julia Roberts, en esta ocasi&oacute;n con Mamma M&iacute;a (2008).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneuprimerpelistreeproberts/img_4606.jpg\" alt=\"img_4606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneuprimerpelistreeproberts/img_4607.jpg\" alt=\"img_4607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneuprimerpelistreeproberts/img_4608.jpg\" alt=\"img_4608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneuprimerpelistreeproberts/img_4609.jpg\" alt=\"img_4609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneuprimerpelistreeproberts/img_4610.jpg\" alt=\"img_4610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneuprimerpelistreeproberts/img_4611.jpg\" alt=\"img_4611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneuprimerpelistreeproberts/img_4612.jpg\" alt=\"img_4612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicineateneuprimerpelistreeproberts/img_4613.jpg\" alt=\"img_4613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
